Package: backup-manager
Version: 1.0.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Backup Manager contributors <backup-manager@localhost>
Depends: nginx, nodejs (>= 18), rsync, cifs-utils, smbclient, openssl, systemd
Description: Local web application for managing SMB/CIFS backups
 Backup Manager provides a local web interface and API for configuring,
 scheduling, and monitoring directory backups to SMB/CIFS shares on Linux.
